      <description>&lt;div&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/dba5b9f925f6a8b11a93bb2a57573287c1af0f58.png?auto=compress,format&amp;h=340&amp;w=1200&amp;s=081b1b919dc47a0a84546971ae0c4bdd"&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/ea00550e937d85ef4ff178d8b0980a17954398ea.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=crop&amp;h=600&amp;w=1200&amp;s=95363942c9232ab64286272d1da03637"&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Survive the city of shadows&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Dive into the supernatural demimonde of Urban Shadows with this bundle of physical game accessories! Now you can level up your literal tabletop with a physical copy of &lt;em&gt;Urban Shadows: Second Edition&lt;/em&gt;, a dice tray and pack of five pairs of dice engraved with the city’s four powerful political Circles, and a Master of Ceremonies screen to hide all the exciting twists and turns from prying eyes. Journey through a city where nothing is as it seems, and forces both mundane and supernatural vie for power over the skyline of shadow! Grab these Urban Shadows accessories at the price of your choosing, and support Tabletop Gaymers with your purchase!  &lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;span style="color: #ef9741;"&gt;Keys expire. Please redeem your keys before December 31st, 2026.  &lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt; ESTIMATED SHIPPING COSTS &lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Your Humble Bundle purchase DOES NOT include shipping fees for this bundle. &lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt; See below the shipping fees.   &lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt; US - $12.00&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt; CA - $15.00 &lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;GB - $19.00  &lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;AT, BE, BG, CY, CZ, DE, DK, EE, ES, FI, FR, GR, HR, HU, IE, IT, LT, LU, LV, MT, NL, PL, PT, RO, SE, SI, &amp; SK - $22.00  &lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt; AU &amp; NZ - $25.00 &lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Rest of the world - $49.00 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#0"&gt;Pay $39 to unlock!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#urbanshadows2ndedition"&gt;Urban Shadows 2nd Edition&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#bt59"&gt;Pay $59 or more to also unlock!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#mcscreenpluscampaignnotepads"&gt;MC Screen + Campaign Notepads&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#urbanshadowsdicetray"&gt;Urban Shadows Dice Tray&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#urbanshadowsdicepack"&gt;Urban Shadows Dice Pack&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2 id="0"&gt;Pay $39 to unlock!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="urbanshadows2ndedition"&gt;&lt;a id="urbanshadows2ndedition"&gt;Urban Shadows 2nd Edition&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/f5afc5006a5084000bb42c8d622b4168afde21f5.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=c435d861f20cad473e7d44261e51756e"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;The city hungers. Will you feed it?&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;The streets bleed shadows as the supernatural politics of the city threaten to swallow you whole. Will you suffer as the savior for those who don't have enough, or take advantage of the weakness in friend and foe alike? Will you fight the darkness... or give in for power?&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;Urban Shadows is an urban fantasy tabletop roleplaying game in which mortals and monsters vie for control of a modern-day city in a political battleground layered just under the reality we think we know. Vampires, faeries, hunters, and wizards fight to carve out a piece of the streets and skyscrapers, ready to make deals with all those who have something to offer.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id="bt59"&gt;Pay $59 or more to also unlock!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="mcscreenpluscampaignnotepads"&gt;&lt;a id="mcscreenpluscampaignnotepads"&gt;MC Screen + Campaign Notepads&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/22ab90ba2e24eebe8d94d9695b7899d89cbc490e.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=d0b30f112bb2e6dadc2e409541820f76"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;/div&gt; &lt;p&gt;This accessory for Urban Shadows contains both a 4-panel Master of Ceremonies Screen—featuring tools, tables, and information for running the game on the back and full-color art on the front—and a Campaign Notepad with 50 double-sided pull-off sheets to help you track your campaign and the NPCs who inhabit your city. Both of these tools condense and refine the material available in standard play materials to make running the game easy!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="urbanshadowsdicetray"&gt;&lt;a id="urbanshadowsdicetray"&gt;Urban Shadows Dice Tray&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/95a1b988071386d948b7d1687ac54769e7e442cc.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=bb9b33fff2d59d134c9a6576166ce2e2"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;The Urban Shadows Dice Tray is a beautiful and useful accessory for Urban Shadows, the roleplaying game. Made of a full-color flexible rubber sheet with a fabric cover and buttons, it easily assembles into a beautiful rolling dice tray at your table. The dice tray features beautiful cityscape artwork, as well as the iconic city circle symbols!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="urbanshadowsdicepack"&gt;&lt;a id="urbanshadowsdicepack"&gt;Urban Shadows Dice Pack&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/e488679fa64ef40649d1b23ca4c0a03859760ce6.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=49490fb8f308889ee24c0e918ad451c7"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Urban Shadows is a political urban fantasy tabletop roleplaying game in which mortals and supernatural creatures alike vie for control in a modern-day city.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;This pack of engraved dice contains five pairs of purple six-sided dice–one pair of “Urban Shadows” dice, and one more set for each of the cities’ Circles, communities with their own internal politics and dramas.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
      <category>books</category>
      <category>Urban Shadows Physical Collection</category>
