ites centered around those places of life within the scorched desert, the lush and green oases.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Winter Trails &lt;/strong&gt;leads you into the silent stillness of a wintry forest, with only the crunch of snow and ice underfoot breaking the license.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;E Prybylski Watercolor&lt;/strong&gt; style is an exquisite hand-drawn, watercolour-look overland style.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
