thon&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#advancedchatbotpromptingtechniqueswithclaudeanthropicapi"&gt;Advanced Chatbot Prompting Techniques with Claude Anthropic API&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#mastercomputervisionwithclaudeaipythonsdkandpracticeexam"&gt;Master Computer Vision with Claude AI Python SDK&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#transformdataintoinsights_aipdfanalysisanddatavisualizationinclaudepythonandmatplotlibwithpracticeexam"&gt;AI PDF Analysis and Data Visualization in Claude, Python and Matplotlib&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#microsoft365certified_copilotandagentadministrationfundamentalswit"&gt;Microsoft 365 Certified: Copilot and Agent Administration Fundamentals with Practice Exam&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#revolutionizingsaleswithclaudeai_in-depthtrainingwithpracticeexam"&gt;Revolutionizing Sales with Claude AI - In-Depth Training&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#claudeaiasanadvancedpersonalassistantwithpracticeexam"&gt;Claude AI as an Advanced Personal Assistant&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#claudeaiindocumentanalysisandmanagementwithpracticeexam"&gt;Claude AI in Document Analysis and Management&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2 id="0"&gt;Pay $5 to unlock!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="aifluencyfundamentals_ethicalandeffectiveaiinteraction"&gt;&lt;a id="aifluencyfundamentals_ethicalandeffectiveaiinteraction" href="https://youtu.be/Q8uCoUeSN5w"&gt;AI Fundamentals: Ethical and Effective AI Interaction&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/1b00425bcfed39e066bbbcd8cfbd2144361dffbc.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=88ed702ab3d31b0a751ac6112d80add2"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Before the tools, learn the ground rules. This video course covers how AI works, when to use it, and how to judge what it gives you.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;You'll go from foundations through workflows to responsible use.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► What AI is, how it generates responses, and its real limits.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Where AI fits, where it performs poorly, and the cost of misuse.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Writing clear instructions, using context, and guiding with examples.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Spotting hallucinations, verifying output, and knowing when to double-check.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The course ends with workflows, human-AI collaboration, bias, over-reliance, and accountability.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Lifetime access to all modules.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Includes 10 unique practice exams with unlimited attempts.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Certificate of Completion&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Start with the fundamentals.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id="bt15"&gt;Pay $15 or more to also unlock!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="creativeinnovationswithclaudeai_in-depthtrainingwithexampreparation"&gt;&lt;a id="creativeinnovationswithclaudeai_in-depthtrainingwithexampreparation" href="https://youtu.be/Q8uCoUeSN5w"&gt;Creative Innovations with Claude AI - In-Depth Training&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/bfb2a72f7e10c69e568f060d74f390c03a84d6ca.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=0a8c7e5c091353eec4c6afb760b7257c"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Creative teams can use AI without losing their voice. This video course covers Claude across content, design feedback, ideation, and curation.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;You'll draft, refine, and generate ideas with AI in the loop.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Drafting outlines, developing content, and editing with Claude.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Design feedback and iterative design improvements.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Generating and developing creative concepts.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Personalized content curation based on user preferences.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;AI works best here as a collaborator, not a replacement.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Lifetime access to all modules.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Certificate of Completion&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Bring Claude into your creative process.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id="bt25"&gt;Pay $25 or more to also unlock!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="claudecertifiedarchitect_professionalccar-pwithpracticeexamfirst-t"&gt;&lt;a id="claudecertifiedarchitect_professionalccar-pwithpracticeexamfirst-t" href="https://youtu.be/Q8uCoUeSN5w"&gt;Claude Certified Architect - Professional (CCAR-P) with Practice Exam (First-Time Exclusive Humble Bundle Release)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/eeb87d83f9a19a4c52af031f1d9fb890bf6c97cf.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=4f1c43a19a63de882a266d64153cbd5e"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;The CCAR-P is the professional-level architect credential for Claude. This video course prepares you for the exam.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Everything inside maps to the professional tier, so you study what gets tested.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Professional-level Claude architecture topics.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► System design for Claude applications.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Exam structure and question style.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Graded practice to check your readiness.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Passing the CCAR-P puts a professional architect credential on your resume.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Lifetime access to all modules.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Includes practice exam with unlimited attempts.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Certificate of Completion&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Start preparing for exam day.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="gpt-6astrafundamentals_fromfirstprompttopracticalapplicationsfirst"&gt;&lt;a id="gpt-6astrafundamentals_fromfirstprompttopracticalapplicationsfirst" href="https://youtu.be/Q8uCoUeSN5w"&gt;GPT-6 Astra Fundamentals: From First Prompt to Practical Applications (First-Time Exclusive Humble Bundle Release)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/e94be1a0da612ed5c564438f7e0198c7f945dff6.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=db40efb5a3686a9362480642324a9f3c"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;GPT‑6 Astra is built for demanding, end-to-end work, but mastering it begins with the fundamentals.&lt;/p