fore the real thing.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Architecture fundamentals for Claude.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Foundational design and deployment concepts.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Exam topic walkthroughs.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Practice that mirrors the exam format.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Lifetime access to all modules.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Includes practice exam with unlimited attempts.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Certificate of Completion&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Limited spots!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="claudecodeplusqwen36_buildlocalaicodingprojectswithanollamabackend"&gt;&lt;a id="claudecodeplusqwen36_buildlocalaicodingprojectswithanollamabackend" href="https://youtu.be/Q8uCoUeSN5w"&gt;Claude Code + Qwen 3.6: Build Local AI Coding Projects with an Ollama Backend&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/b754a5abf0d5d872745099465659087806a4d89b.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=46ff6329fb7d5fbeef1193d46141f13e"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Cloud AI is convenient until you want your code to stay on your machine. This video course sets up Claude Code with Qwen 3.6 running on a local Ollama backend.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;You'll install Ollama, connect Claude Code, and build real projects, including a website generated from a single prompt.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Installing Ollama and running your first conversation.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Choosing models and useful terminal commands.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Building a website from one prompt, then improving it.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Editing existing repositories with your local setup.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;By the end you'll have a working local AI coding stack and projects built with it.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Lifetime access to all modules.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Certificate of Completion&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Set up your local stack and start building.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="modelcontextprotocolinllmproduction_scalableserverdeployment"&gt;&lt;a id="modelcontextprotocolinllmproduction_scalableserverdeployment" href="https://youtu.be/Q8uCoUeSN5w"