designed for platformers, brawlers, and fast-paced arcade titles. Covers swings, dashes, dodges, jumps, and whooshes with punchy transients and satisfying air-cut textures that sell speed and momentum. Ideal for combo attacks and traversal mechanics where every move needs to feel snappy and responsive.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="guns"&gt;&lt;a id="guns"&gt;Guns&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/6329826694cbf482bcf1bcc876486ab0f45c2d59.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=d1c3676581e3ce52788c0c0209c860ce"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;A versatile arsenal of firearm sound effects covering a range of weapon types, from sharp pistol cracks to heavier automatic fire. Includes shots, and where applicable, complementary elements like mechanical reloads or impacts, giving developers the raw material to build out a full combat audio system. Built for shooters, action games, and any project that needs weapon sounds with punch, clarity, and cut-through in a busy mix.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id="bt15"&gt;Pay $15 or more to also unlock!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="technotexturesandsfx"&gt;&lt;a id="technotexturesandsfx"&gt;Techno Textures and SFX&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/7f3d9cef79864c01dff3eb3b6bc8db3c57567c8e.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=dec5619180195efe716eb9760067e90c"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;A collection of textural and sound-design elements drawn from electronic and techno production, covering risers, drones, hits, and atmospheric layers. Built to add depth, tension, and movement to a mix. Useful for electronic music production, transitions, and any project needing a modern, club-inspired sonic palette.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="modernmusickits"&gt;&lt;a id="modernmusickits"&gt;Modern Music Kits&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/dd8d8a87f6fe227717fa1d365f319ac652f9d33d.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=f5fcf80dd0cbb816984ccde3bfb2476a"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;A production-ready collection of contemporary music elements, covering drum hits, loops, suited to modern genres. Gives producers a flexible starting point for building tracks across current styles. Useful for music production, remixing, and any project needing up-to-date, genre-relevant sound sources.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id="bt25"&gt;Pay $25 or more to also unlock!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="blustershots"&gt;&lt;a id="blustershots"&gt;Bluster Shots&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/0820d2e0bbc32ec76bacea3643daf89ad2020d2c.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=34b1e98bfd6fd295be436d4648cb750f"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;A collection of blaster-style laser and energy weapon sounds, from quick single-shot pulses to sustained charged blasts. Covers a range of pitches and intensities for sci-fi combat, ray guns, and futuristic weaponry. Great for space shooters, sci-fi action games, and any project needing punchy, energetic ranged-attack sounds.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="8-bitsfx"&gt;&lt;a id="8-bitsfx"&gt;8-Bit SFX&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/f82ff9cdf8b6f40c884cb0f2913eefbd5919daa5.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=5d712ac038fcea233017ead88ca59c34"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;A retro chiptune sound library covering jumps, hits, pickups, power-ups, and menu blips in classic 8-bit style. Captures the crunchy, nostalgic character of vintage console games. Perfect for retro platformers, pixel-art titles, and any project chasing that authentic old-school arcade feel.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="magicspellsandattacksfx"&gt;&lt;a id="magicspellsandattacksfx"&gt;Magic Spells &amp; Attack SFX&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/e5c8048ad9f4858a4e179ed3ca1d933e56d6f07c.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=90e00e6d5bb8bf209b9ea4d2802e6ddb"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;A spellcasting and combat library covering charge-ups, casts, impacts, and elemental effects like fire, ice, and lightning. Built to sell the power and variety of a fantasy magic system. Ideal for RPGs, action-adventure titles, and any game with spellcasters, abilities, or special attacks.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="checkpointserrorsandriddlessfx"&gt;&lt;a id="checkpointserrorsandriddlessfx"&gt;Checkpoints, Errors And Riddles SFX&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/40273e2ad8ee58691d17e476223f27034cc2c677.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=dfef9957c87c725955b6849fc168c689"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;A functional UI and feedback library covering checkpoint saves, error buzzes, puzzle-solving cues, and riddle-related stingers. Gives clear, readable audio feedback for player progress and mistakes. Useful for puzzle games, adventure titles, and any interface that needs to communicate success, failure, or progress at a glance.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="warstrategy"&gt;&lt;a id="warstrategy"&gt;War Strategy&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/f925b8e7ea2d9937bbe0c7736ca8bdb93f1102ce.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=e345678d5b5c64f086649ef4206e729c"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;A voice-over library of military and strategic command lines, covering orders, and battlefield chatter. Delivers the tone of commanders and troops coordinating in real time. Built for RTS titles, war games, and strategy simulations needing authentic military voice direction.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="shooterradiocommands"&gt;&lt;a id="shooterradiocommands"&gt;Shooter Radio Commands&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/9acce53868f77171816ac9c250f2d8eac15bc665.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=a2ee513bace5a3b626f7dfb577cac1ee"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;A voice pack of radio-style tactical callouts, covering squad communication, status updates, and combat commands as heard over comms. Captures the clipped, urgent tone of team-based radio chatter. Ideal for tactical shooters, military FPS titles, and squad-based multiplayer games.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="adventure"&gt;&lt;a id="adventure"&gt;Adventure&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/4f05b45b8617d2e4d4dfe391773814d2d1306b79.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=46dfa973b5a3451ea37339363deed66e"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;A voice-over collection of general adventure-themed lines, covering exclamations, reactions, and exploration-driven dialogue. Brings personality and energy to characters navigating quests and discovery. Suited for action-adventure games, exploration titles, and story-driven projects needing lively character voice work.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="monstersbossandzombies"&gt;&lt;a id="monstersbossandzombies"&gt;Monsters, Boss &amp; Zombies&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/231f0945fcbef0e12c4f9556c8ef49b2d124edd3.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=b9e4cd7342da6e7a5273fe2ce7a363cb"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;A voice pack of creature and monster vocalizations, including growls, roars, boss taunts, and zombie groans. Delivers a wide range of menacing, non-human character voices. Perfect for horror games, dungeon crawlers, and any title needing intimidating enemy or boss presence.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="clothingfabricandmaterials"&gt;&lt;a id="clothingfabricandmaterials"&gt;Clothing, Fabric &amp; Materials&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/39ff624ff32f16f6db710fa4c5e17ae071cf83fe.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=3ed725ed424362cb41fe195d2ba1e0fb"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;A foley library capturing the movement and texture of fabric, clothing, and soft materials, from rustles and swishes to friction and folds. Adds realistic detail to character movement and costume interaction. Useful for cinematic games, character animation, and any scene needing believable wardrobe sound.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="doors_functionloops"&gt;&lt;a id="doors_functionloops"&gt;Doors&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/f6ca3a5fe46157f8bb2392f20c255a1958c113b6.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=925a4390606fd154abdbf60193bdfe57"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;A comprehensive door sound library covering opens, closes, creaks, slams, and latches across a range of door types and materials. Adds realism and spatial detail to environments and transitions. Essential for level design, environmental storytelling, and any game with interactive spaces.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="foley_functionloops"&gt;&lt;a id="foley_functionloops"&gt;Foley&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/74b6fc0790a8264625c8d31c4c60b129387db58b.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=088c809777d98b38dfc9756001c8638d"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;A general-purpose foley library covering everyday object interaction. Adds natural, grounded texture to character actions. Useful across nearly any genre needing realistic ambient human sound.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="householdfoleyanddevices"&gt;&lt;a id="householdfoleyanddevices"&gt;Household Foley &amp; Devices&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/49e2c910e9847074ea4cb5603f4aa19e63275a4c.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=9f17910bddad525794044754580aafc4"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;A foley library focused on household objects and devices, covering appliances, gadgets, switches, and everyday mechanical interactions around the home. Adds believable domestic texture to interiors. Ideal for life-sim games, narrative titles, and any project set in home environments.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="kitchencooking"&gt;&lt;a id="kitchencooking"&gt;Kitchen, Cooking&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/1cdbfb0ed8f7e897cc7e4978796ceacbd0833208.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=ef8fe9b2f79d7c588f4a01bfa7f41518"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;A foley library of kitchen and cooking sounds, covering chopping, sizzling, utensils, appliances, and food prep. Brings texture and realism to culinary gameplay and scenes. Great for cooking games, life-sim titles, and any project with kitchen or restaurant environments.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="dreamywhooshes"&gt;&lt;a id="dreamywhooshes"&gt;Dreamy Whooshes&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/5fd6048ea8b888a129e4e3d1a87b0583a3cc78ab.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=3ce652773be45233351ef52759bbf689"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;A collection of ethereal whoosh and transition sounds with a light, airy character. Designed for scene changes, sequences, and movement. Useful for narrative games and any project needing smooth transitions.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="glitches"&gt;&lt;a id="glitches"&gt;Glitches&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/ca0cb39bc6bdd2bb336a48053c6d3a05bd164c2b.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=1b9060bbcd639a1b70127fe287e74063"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;A library of digital glitch and distortion effects, covering stutters, corruption, static bursts, and signal breakup. Adds a broken, technological edge to transitions and effects. Ideal for sci-fi games, horror titles, and any project needing a digital malfunction aesthetic.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="granular_functionloops"&gt;&lt;a id="granular_functionloops"&gt;Granular&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/859d4b13de0aac0c3ff7521be089e4822d42f1a1.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=e8e4f896e2543860aa2e87fed4f1cb9a"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;A collection of granular-synthesized textures and effects, built from tiny fragmented sound particles blended into evolving, abstract tones. Offers unique, otherworldly sonic material. Useful for experimental sound design, ambient layers, and sci-fi or surreal game atmospheres.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="notificationsfx"&gt;&lt;a id="notificationsfx"&gt;Notification SFX&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/41049cf0250f4d849827440e388caae828a23efb.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=16a5098bd1fee5f4d5c7a898bd91a385"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;A set of short, clear notification sounds covering alerts, pings, and pop-up cues. Designed to be immediately readable without being intrusive. Useful for apps, UI systems, and games needing lightweight feedback for messages, achievements, or reminders.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="uiclicks"&gt;&lt;a id="uiclicks"&gt;UI Clicks&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/ffbf05594f404e6055673f97048595b24351f822.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=cf23d3dc9be691f8ccf384cc84f4646a"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;A focused library of clean interface click sounds covering buttons, toggles, and selections. Built for crisp, satisfying tactile feedback across menus and interfaces. Essential for any game or app needing consistent, polished UI interaction sound.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="uigamesinterface"&gt;&lt;a id="uigamesinterface"&gt;UI Games Interface&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/2790b6167b38f9c6091151a9e55bd0fed9a51929.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=b4b2669912f6a2fb216bc6de0857fbb3"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;A broad game UI library covering menu navigation, confirmations, selections, and interface transitions. Gives a cohesive sonic identity to a game's menu and HUD systems. Useful across nearly any genre needing a full interface sound set.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="uisci-fiinterface"&gt;&lt;a id="uisci-fiinterface"&gt;UI Sci-Fi Interface&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/1db05b1f57fa699424b12ea80aad8890f9e13436.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=da016ee0281192b1aead55746f15660e"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;A futuristic UI library covering holographic-style menus, sci-fi confirmations, and high-tech interface sounds. Adds a sleek, technological character to menus and HUDs. Ideal for sci-fi games, space titles, and any interface wanting an advanced, digital feel.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="alarmsandsirens"&gt;&lt;a id="alarmsandsirens"&gt;Alarms &amp; Sirens&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/1ab6a29d036c038ed28a5540e2f2f9cbbe756137.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=a5bf24b10d250aa4fc57a4fea43fe254"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;A library of alarm and siren sounds covering warnings, alerts, and emergency signals across a range of tones and urgency levels. Adds tension and stakes to critical moments. Useful for action games, horror titles, and any scene needing an escalating sense of danger.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="orchestralbraams"&gt;&lt;a id="orchestralbraams"&gt;Orchestral Braams&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/a37c5f2903cee62c62e15ee344efb575af1925b8.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=944a5b3f825991f4978316270bbc2751"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;A collection of deep, cinematic braam hits, the sustained brass-and-low-end swells used for dramatic trailer and reveal moments. Delivers weight and tension in a single hit. Perfect for cutscenes, trailers, and big narrative or boss-reveal moments.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="orchestralimpacts"&gt;&lt;a id="orchestralimpacts"&gt;Orchestral Impacts&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/115e8becf132d6140b618ff89c1664e8aa4be6bc.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=48846301a0864cb596b5398c71e5817e"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;A library of large cinematic impact hits combining percussion, brass, and low-end for dramatic emphasis. Adds power and punctuation to key moments. Ideal for trailers, cutscenes, and any scene needing a big, weighty musical punctuation point.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="orchestralwhooshes"&gt;&lt;a id="orchestralwhooshes"&gt;Orchestral Whooshes&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/5b6eef8b0eab7d8868925673b3d34fc54b8d7d10.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=390304ee7b11653b45933be96585e183"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;A collection of sweeping orchestral whoosh effects built for cinematic transitions. Adds dramatic motion and scale to scene changes. Useful for trailers, cutscenes, and epic transitions in narrative or action games.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="horrorambience"&gt;&lt;a id="horrorambience"&gt;Horror Ambience&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/7db0b00c1adcb9fe6694d69825724af2a9799290.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=7eb6bdc17a555f14f2981adebeaadf7c"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;A library of unsettling ambient beds and drones designed to build dread and tension over time. Covers low rumbles, eerie tones, and creeping atmospheric textures. Essential for horror games, thriller titles, and any scene needing a sustained sense of unease.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="horrorscreamers"&gt;&lt;a id="horrorscreamers"&gt;Horror Screamers&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/bb26d1bd7177244329c34ef27ce963a3909e6c70.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=cf5ef618b91c9842873224339ea71e95"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;A collection of sudden shock and scare stingers designed for jump-scare moments. Delivers sharp, high-impact hits timed for maximum startle. Built for horror games and any title relying on sudden fright beats.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="ambienceandsfx"&gt;&lt;a id="ambienceandsfx"&gt;Ambience &amp; SFX&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/48a381f088f43b4d075ef359795df10b7510871a.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=eca9326c64e2787b58ef324b4fee5b21"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;A mixed library combining general ambient beds with supporting sound effects across a variety of environments and moods. Offers flexible atmospheric coverage for scenes that need both background texture and punctual effects. Useful across a wide range of genres and settings.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="ambiencespaceandplanet"&gt;&lt;a id="ambiencespaceandplanet"&gt;Ambience Space &amp; Planet&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/6335695cd178524ec8139a0e8b93070c9f0dab92.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=c9dcabe0e359d7e125e535d46bd77768"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;A collection of ambient beds and textures evoking space, alien worlds, and planetary environments. Covers deep drones, cosmic textures, and otherworldly atmospheres. Ideal for sci-fi games, space exploration titles, and any scene set beyond Earth.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="messagessfx"&gt;&lt;a id="messagessfx"&gt;Messages SFX&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/dee8d5a1e9305bb373a09fe8db42ddd9d5c7e28d.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=09d528ae93bf92894815b9e61959301b"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;A library of short sound cues for incoming and outgoing messages, covering pings, chimes, and confirmation tones. Designed for clear, lightweight feedback in communication systems. Useful for games and apps with messaging, chat, or mail mechanics.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="medievalfighting"&gt;&lt;a id="medievalfighting"&gt;Medieval Fighting&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/526b94ea06c01447699c20582d331b4529e8906a.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=60dac2c0fe2cc6eea6a05d6881aec569"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;A combat sound library covering sword clashes, splintering arrows, and melee impacts in a medieval setting. Adds weight and realism to close-quarters combat. Perfect for fantasy RPGs, medieval action games, and any title with sword-and-shield combat.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="drumkitsvirtualinstrumentplugin"&gt;&lt;a id="drumkitsvirtualinstrumentplugin"&gt;DRUMKITS Virtual Instrument Plugin&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/19dd42fbae56cbb557ff7fe3ead4073b8886faeb.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=5b68b6cbb4f42ff181a5898c2bb7003b"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;A first-time Humble Bundle release; DrumKit is a virtual instrument plugin featuring 173 drum kits split across 4 expansions, delivering a total of 1,384 drum sounds.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The plugin offers 8 drum slots, each with dedicated Pitch, Attack, Pan, and Gain controls, allowing you to quickly shape and balance every sound in the kit. Global controls include Gain, Room, Distortion, and Filter, making it easy to add space, character, and tonal shaping without leaving the plugin.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;An integrated preset browser gives you quick access to all included kits and expansions. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;​Available in VST3 for Windows and VST3 &amp;amp; AU for Mac.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="1984retromusicproductionbundle"&gt;&lt;a id="1984retromusicproductionbundle"&gt;1984 Retro Music Production Bundle&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/f58cffc2236b80f1d389701dcbbdcc61a5f40178.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=6212c4cd298023dec7b354c9f5d63a47"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;"1984 - Retro Music Production Bundle" is a an exclusive bundle coming only to Humble Bundle!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Made for producers who want that classic retro-futuristic sound without overcomplicating the process. Inspired by vintage synthesizers, chrome textures, VHS colors, and the atmosphere of the 80s, this pack brings together everything you need to create nostalgic, cinematic, and energetic tracks.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="abyss_darkcinematic"&gt;&lt;a id="abyss_darkcinematic"&gt;ABYSS - Dark Cinematic&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/2d60cb299e921a87893677d738d56cb3b49aba93.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=7704b373f304970a0a999e0b43d865df"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;An unreleased premium cinematic sample library designed for composers and sound designers who need to evoke tension, mystery, and raw emotional depth.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Whether you are scoring a psychological thriller, a dystopian sci-fi epic, or a bone-chilling horror film, this pack provides the dark, &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;immersive sonic palette required to pull your audience into the void.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This is a Humble Bundle exclusive release.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
