#pythonaiproject_webappwithflaskwhisper"&gt;Python AI Project - Web App with Flask and Whisper&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#buildamedicaldiagnosisbotwithpython"&gt;Build a Medical Diagnosis Bot with Python&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#convolutionalneuralnetworksforimageclassification"&gt;Convolutional Neural Networks for Image Classification&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#machinelearningwithpythonandtensorflow"&gt;Machine Learning with Python and Tensorflow&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#nextjsproject_ai-poweredexpensetracker"&gt;Next.js Project - AI-Powered Expense Tracker&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#introtonextjsforwebappdevelopment"&gt;Intro to Next.js for Web App Development&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#buildwebappswithreact19"&gt;Build Web Apps with React 19&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#introtodjangoforpythonwebappdevelopment2025edition"&gt;Intro to Django for Python Web App Development&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#masterdatabasesandformsfordjangowebapps"&gt;Master Databases and Forms for Django Web Apps&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#buildasaasappwithpython_unit1_backend"&gt;Build a SaaS App with Python - Unit 1 - Backend&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#buildasaasappwithpython_unit2_frontend"&gt;Build a SaaS App with Python - Unit 2 - Frontend&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#awscertifiedaipractitioneraif-c01_prepandpass"&gt;AWS Certified AI Practitioner (AIF-C01): Prep &amp; Pass&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#10practiceexamsforawscertifiedaipractitioneraif-c01"&gt;10 Practice Exams for AWS Certified AI Practitioner (AIF-C01)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2 id="0"&gt;Pay $5 to unlock!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="beginningsql_storeandqueryyourdata"&gt;&lt;a id="beginningsql_storeandqueryyourdata" href="https://youtu.be/gNntxC-ysVI"&gt;Beginning SQL - Store and Query Your Data&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Learn the basics of SQL - the world's most popular language for querying databases.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Used to update databases, retrieve data for analysis, and more, knowing how to use it is an essential data science skill.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;In this course, you'll learn SQL by working with a real music database, and using queries to gain usable insights. We'll be utilizing SQLite and Python.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;You will learn how to:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Run SQL queries using Python and SQLlite&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Query data&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Sort data&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Group and aggregate data&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Join data&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 id="intermediatesql_createandalterdatabases"&gt;&lt;a id="intermediatesql_createandalterdatabases" href="https://youtu.be/vkDXsJAtzAE"&gt;Intermediate SQL - Create and Alter Databases&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Master SQLite, the popular database engine, by learning to create your own databases.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Databases are a core method of storage for data in many different industries - including bank accounts, sales data, and more. Working with both SQLite and Python, you'll learn the key CRUD skills required to start creating your own database tables. You'll also learn how to combine this with database queries to not only verify your database setup, but also discover how to control your data completely.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;No matter your data storage needs, you'll learn the techniques needed to build databases for any number of projects.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;You will learn how to:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Set up an environment for databases&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Create an initial database table&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Insert, update, and delete database elements&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Remove entire tables&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Manage foreign key constraints&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2 id="bt15"&gt;Pay $15 or more to also unlock!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="probabilityfoundationsfordatascience"&gt;&lt;a id="probabilityfoundationsfordatascience" href="https://youtu.be/meJ6RZkEncs"&gt;Probability Foundations for Data Science&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Probability - the ability to predict the likelihood of an event occurring - is crucial knowledge for anyone interested in data science and analysis. Probability has innumerable applications in a wide variety of fields - including comprising of the core of many machine learning and data science algorithms.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;From a basic understanding of Probability fundamentals and common terminology, to understanding conditional probability and Bayes Theorem, this course will provide you with all you need to begin making accurate predictions. Finally, you will apply your knowledge by building a Naïve Bayes Classifier that predicts whether or not a flight will arrive on time using a set of real-world data.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="completepythondatavisualizationcourse"&gt;&lt;a id="completepythondatavisualizationcourse" href="https://youtu.be/GrRM0cwxRSk"&gt;The Complete Python Data Visualization Course&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Showcase your data efficiently by exploring data visualization with Python!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Plotting is a fundamental aspect of data science, allowing you to visually communicate your findings, quickly deduce insights, and make your data more appealing. In this course, you'll learn how to display beautiful charts and plots for different types of data using three popular Python plotting libraries: Matplotlib, Seaborn, and Bokeh. These universally applicable skills will make interpreting and showing your data easier than ever before and give you key presentation skills for any data science project.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;You will learn how to create: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;Column charts&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Pie charts&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Line and multiline charts&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Scatter plots&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Joint plots&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Interactive elements&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;... and more!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id="bt25"&gt;Pay $25 or more to also unlock!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="introtoagenticcodingwithclaudecode"&gt;&lt;a id="introtoagenticcodingwithclaudecode" href="https://youtu.be/fmAo0iRWRzw"&gt;Intro to Agentic Coding with Claude Code&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;AI-assisted development is changing how software is built by helping developers plan, make, debug, and refine real projects.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;In this course, you’ll learn how to use Claude Code through a practical workflow that includes managing context, writing better instructions, using Plan Mode, and creating reusable project files for more consistent coding sessions.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;By the end of the course, you'll be able to confidently direct Claude Code through real development tasks while staying in control of the code it produces.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You'll learn how to:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Set up and use Claude Code effectively&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Manage context and write better prompts for reliable results&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Create reusable workflows&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Direct AI coding tasks with greater confidence and control&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Build a foundation for modern agentic AI development&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt; ... and more!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="saasappwithpython_stripeintegration"&gt;&lt;a id="saasappwithpython_stripeintegration" href="https://youtu.be/pJ31p59KCDE"&gt;SaaS App with Python - Stripe Integration&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Build a fully-fledged SaaS payment backend with Python and Stripe!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Payments are the cornerstone of any successful SaaS app, enabling growth, trust, and sustainability in a real-world product. In this course, you’ll take a practical journey through Stripe integration using Python and FastAPI, learning how to connect every piece, from secure authentication to tracking each transaction within your database. By mastering these workflows from start to finish, you’ll empower your applications to handle the complexities of modern payment systems.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;You’ll learn how to:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;Connect FastAPI with secure Stripe keys&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Build end-to-end checkout flows&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Verify Stripe webhooks and manage events&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Update user credits after payments&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Expose API endpoints for front-ends&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Test payment flows with Stripe CLI&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;... and more!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="agenticaiwithclaudecodeandmcp"&gt;&lt;a id="agenticaiwithclaudecodeandmcp" href="https://youtu.be/ewqM7ZWw49k"&gt;Agentic AI with Claude Code &amp; MCP&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Master agentic AI workflows and scale your development with Model Context Protocol (MCP) servers!&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;Modern software engineering increasingly relies on connecting intelligent AI models to specialized tools to solve complex development challenges. In this course, you'll explore real-world examples that connect AI models to external tools, data, and structured capabilities. These advanced techniques will allow you to design custom, reusable agentic workflows that significantly streamline your professional development pipeline.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You'll learn how to:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;Configure Model Context Protocol servers&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Integrate external file system tools&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Automate GitHub issue-to-PR workflows&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Navigate live sites using Playwright&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Define behaviors with agentic configurations&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Package reusable AI-driven skill sets&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;... and more!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="buildafull-stackappwithclaudecode"&gt;&lt;a id="buildafull-stackappwithclaudecode" href="https://youtu.be/1jSVVcHcP20"&gt;Build a Full-Stack App with Claude Code&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Unlock streamlined, AI-assisted development with Claude Code!&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;AI-assisted coding opens entirely new doors for building real-world projects quickly and intuitively. In this course, you’ll use Claude Code to vibe code a complete slide presentation generator, transforming Markdown into polished, interactive slide decks with conversational AI as your coding assistant. By learning these skills, you’ll be ready to leverage AI-powered development for your next web projects and bring innovative ideas to life.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;You’ll learn how to:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;Plan and scaffold apps using Claude Code&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Generate and debug code via conversation&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Connect React and Node.js with AI help&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Integrate AI APIs for presentation features&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Refine user experience through AI feedback&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Troubleshoot and iterate with AI guidance&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;p&gt;... and more!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="buildmulti-modalaiappswithollama"&gt;&lt;a id="buildmulti-modalaiappswithollama" href="https://youtu.be/jmwEGqr-DlE"&gt;Build Multi-Modal AI Apps with Ollama&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/6c870991157f9764913a5096a0418c0bae224356.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=e6f3d4499c69d8a6f747b33561813ada"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Bring AI-powered apps to your local machine with Ollama!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ollama is a cutting-edge application designed to simplify and unify the process of accessing Large Language Models (LLMs) on your own computer hardware. Through this course, you'll explore how to work with Ollama's efficient API to create chatbots and multi-modal projects using popular LLM models such as Llama 2 and LLaVA. These skills will enhance your privacy control for AI projects and give you ways to build projects offline.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;You will learn how to:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Understand local LLM pros and cons&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Set up Ollama and different models&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Send and receive text requests&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Work with API calls for images&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Create a fully-fledged chatbot&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Log image data to CSV files&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;... and more!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="introtoagenticcodingwithcodex_zenva"&gt;&lt;a id="introtoagenticcodingwithcodex_zenva" href="https://youtu.be/KDU0JOGgD9k"&gt;Intro to Agentic Coding with Codex&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Start coding with Codex confidently!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;AI coding tools are most useful when you understand how to guide them and keep their actions under control. In this course, you'll build strong foundations for working with Codex, progressing from your first session to structured, controlled project work. With this grounding, you can move on to complete AI-assisted coding projects while keeping every step reviewable and predictable.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You'll learn how to:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Install and configure Codex&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Navigate Codex's terminal interface&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Manage context across sessions&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Write outcome-focused prompts&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Build AGENTS.md rules and skills&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Configure permissions and sandboxing&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;... and more!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="practicalagenticworkflowswithcodex"&gt;&lt;a id="practicalagenticworkflowswithcodex" href="https://youtu.be/vngGApQH1dU"&gt;Practical Agentic Workflows with Codex&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Take control of every Codex coding session!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;AI-assisted coding becomes more reliable when speed is paired with structured workflows that keep developers in control. In this course, you'll practice complete, real-world workflows for guiding Codex through coding tasks while keeping progress verifiable and predictable. With these workflows, you can move on to larger AI-assisted development projects while keeping every change reviewable and your codebase under control.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You'll learn how to:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Automate checks for Codex output&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Debug failures with structured prompts&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Review AI-generated diffs rigorously&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Delegate focused tasks to subagents&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Coordinate isolated parallel sessions&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Build reusable skills and hooks&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;... and more!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="buildareal-worldapplicationwithcodex"&gt;&lt;a id="buildareal-worldapplicationwithcodex" href="https://youtu.be/KAdc63F79i0"&gt;Build a Real-World Application with Codex&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Build a complete full-stack app with Codex!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Structured AI-assisted development helps transform complex application ideas into reliable, maintainable software. In this course, you'll use Codex to plan, build, review, and test a complete full-stack invoice tracker from start to finish. With these skills, you can move on to larger AI-assisted web applications while keeping architecture, changes, and quality under control.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You'll learn how to:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Plan projects in Codex plan mode&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Define durable AGENTS.md rules&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Build Next.js and SQLite workflows&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Coordinate subagents and parallel sessions&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Review changes with Git diffs&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Test and harden edge cases&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;... and more!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="bestpracticesforagenticcodingwithcodex"&gt;&lt;a id="bestpracticesforagenticcodingwithcodex" href="https://youtu.be/me2ZAd2z2TY"&gt;Best Practices for Agentic Coding with Codex&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Take command of your Codex workflows!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Successful agentic coding depends on clear direction, focused context, and disciplined verification to keep AI-generated changes under control. In this course, you'll adopt Codex best practices and develop the judgment and complete operating toolkit needed to turn weak sessions into structured, repeatable workflows across individual and team projects. With these skills, you can move on to larger AI-assisted development projects while avoiding correction spirals and keeping progress predictable.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You'll learn how to:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Direct Codex with clear intent&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Write precise, flexible prompts&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Design focused session contexts&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Scale AGENTS.md guidance across teams&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Verify changes through careful diffs&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Diagnose and reset failed sessions&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;... and more!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="bestpracticesforai-poweredcodingwithclaudecode"&gt;&lt;a id="bestpracticesforai-poweredcodingwithclaudecode" href="https://youtu.be/3w814AaiAFY"&gt;Best Practices for AI-Powered Coding with Claude Code&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Unlock the secrets of AI-powered coding with Claude Code!&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;AI is transforming the way software is built, but mastering it means going far beyond simple prompts. In this course, you’ll gain hands-on experience working inside a real-world project - learning how to use Claude Code and tools like it with precision, safety, and confidence from start to finish. As you master structuring, refining, and controlling AI workflows, you’ll be equipped to apply advanced best practices for integrating AI into any production codebase.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’ll learn how to:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;Direct AI tools with strong prompts&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Prevent "architectural drift" in projects&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Design and implement guardrails effectively&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Implement safe project modification workflows&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Use scratchpads for structured planning&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Expand custom features in live apps&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;... and more!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="practicalaidevelopmentworkflowswithclaudecode"&gt;&lt;a id="practicalaidevelopmentworkflowswithclaudecode" href="https://youtu.be/gL0NXJj2DNA"&gt;Practical AI Development Workflows with Claude Code&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Sharpen your Claude Code workflow for real-world development!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;AI-assisted development becomes far more powerful when paired with reliable debugging, automation, and context management habits. In this course, you'll create a personalized system for guiding Claude Code through complex projects while keeping outputs focused, testable, and aligned with your standards. These skills will help you improve daily coding workflows from start to finish with stronger oversight, cleaner iteration, and less repetitive manual work.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You'll learn how to:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Apply advanced debugging strategies&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Run parallel Claude sessions&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Manage context with sub-agents&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Automate tasks with hooks&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Create custom workflow commands&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Build verification habits&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt; ... and more!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="agenticaidevelopmentwithopencode"&gt;&lt;a id="agenticaidevelopmentwithopencode" href="https://youtu.be/V4eS9N_y9Yg"&gt;Agentic AI Development with OpenCode&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Master professional-grade AI agent integration to supercharge your development workflow!&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;Modern software engineering increasingly requires structured, repeatable AI workflows rather than unpredictable prompt-based coding. In this course, you will master the open-source tool OpenCode to integrate intelligent agents directly into your codebase, ensuring a safe, transparent, and fully-fledged development process. These techniques will empower you to leverage powerful AI models to maintain, refactor, and scale your applications with complete control.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You'll learn how to:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;Set up custom OpenCode environments&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Connect diverse AI model providers&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Navigate codebases using intelligent agents&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Customize agent behavior with guidance&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Execute secure code review loops&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Run local models for privacy&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;... and more!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="learnvibecodingwithcursor"&gt;&lt;a id="learnvibecodingwithcursor" href="https://youtu.be/jNKvCF6RxtE"&gt;Learn Vibe Coding with Cursor&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Unlock productivity with vibe coding and AI-driven development using Cursor.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;Vibe coding is transforming how projects get made: simply share your ideas and let AI handle the technical details - so you can build more, faster. In this course, you’ll immerse yourself in the vibe coding approach as you use Cursor to create a complete, real-world Flask image resizer from start to finish. With practical exercises and step-by-step guidance, you’ll discover how Cursor and vibe coding supercharges your workflow, letting you focus on creativity and results.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;You’ll learn how to:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;Adopt the vibe coding mindset&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Boost productivity with Cursor’s features&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Write powerful, effective AI prompts&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Build a Flask image resizer app&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Test, secure, and expand your code&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Apply vibe coding to any project&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;p&gt;... and more!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="promptengineeringforprogrammers_zenva"&gt;&lt;a id="promptengineeringforprogrammers_zenva" href="https://youtu.be/YoSgdwuYs_Y"&gt;Prompt Engineering for Programmers&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Modernize your approach to development with AI!&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;AI is vastly changing the tech industry with new and intuitive techniques for development. You'll explore how to apply AI to your coding projects and render prompts that help you code, debug, and learn programming - fast! These skills will give you amazing tools to boost your productivity and overall enhance how you code.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;With AI, you will learn how to:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;Prompt AI for different scenarios&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Generate code in different languages&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Clean &amp;amp; optimize current code&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Produce commit messages &amp;amp; documentation&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Get testing and debugging help&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Tune prompts for certain outcomes&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;p&gt;... and more!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="introtodevelopingaiagentswithpythonandcrewai"&gt;&lt;a id="introtodevelopingaiagentswithpythonandcrewai" href="https://youtu.be/T74czwa3PXc"&gt;Intro to Developing AI Agents with Python &amp; CrewAI&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Master multi-agent AI and create intelligent applications!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;In the world of AI, multi-agent systems are a groundbreaking approach where intelligent agents work together to solve complex tasks. Through this course, you'll unlock the power of CrewAI – a robust framework for building collaborative AI systems – by exploring real-world projects where agents communicate, share knowledge, and collaborate on research tasks seamlessly. These skills will allow you to create increasingly complex AI solutions and optimize workflows efficiently.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;You’ll learn how to:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Set up and configure CrewAI projects&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Create and customize multi-agent systems&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Integrate cloud-based and local LLMs&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Define and execute agent-specific tasks&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Optimize agents for long-running operations&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Develop custom AI tools for unique needs&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;... and more!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="aiagentprojectwithpythonandcrewai"&gt;&lt;a id="aiagentprojectwithpythonandcrewai" href="https://youtu.be/3l1AhJLiO3M"&gt;AI Agent Project with Python &amp; CrewAI&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Create an AI-powered study assistant with Python and CrewAI!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;AI-powered applications are revolutionizing productivity and education, making learning smarter and more personalized. In this course, you’ll develop a complete Study Buddy app using the CrewAI framework that processes PDFs, generates concise summaries, and creates quizzes and flashcards to reinforce knowledge. With these skills, you’ll understand how to build advanced multi-agent AI systems and gain the expertise to design similar real-world applications.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;You’ll learn how to:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Set up an AI-driven agent app&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Manage multi-agent tasks seamlessly&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Process text with OpenAI’s API&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Integrate local large language models&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Create terminal-based flashcard commands&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Generate quizzes from summarized content&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;... and more!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="pythonaiproject_webappwithflaskwhisper"&gt;&lt;a id="pythonaiproject_webappwithflaskwhisper" href="https://youtu.be/SRLxG-Ec7x0"&gt;Python AI Project - Web App with Flask and Whisper&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Unlock the power of AI audio transcription with OpenAI's Whisper model!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Modern AI has revolutionized task automation, including audio transcription which can be both tedious and time-consuming. Through this course, you'll use the Python Flask web framework to make a web app that allows users to upload or record audio - which is then transcribed using the Whisper model! These skills will allow you to process audio efficiently and provide you with data that can be used and rendered for other tasks.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;You will learn how to:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Work with OpenAI's Whisper API&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Translate non-English audio&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Transcribe audio through AI&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Integrate APIs with Flask apps&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Work with uploaded files&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Record and temporarily save audio&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;... and more!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="buildamedicaldiagnosisbotwithpython"&gt;&lt;a id="buildamedicaldiagnosisbotwithpython" href="https://youtu.be/f4mPiCDkqtw"&gt;Build a Medical Diagnosis Bot with Python&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Explore problem-solving with programming by making a medical bot!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Programs solve different real-world problems across multiple industries, including how we approach health and medicine. In this course, you'll use Python to create a text-based medical bot that walks users through diagnosing dehydration - all while exploring writing algorithms, project management, and more. These skills will not only show you how to turn your ideas into practical Python apps, but help you understand the impact programs have on the world.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;You will learn how to:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;Manage coding projects&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Design and implement algorithms&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Create decision-based questionnaires&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Process output and user input&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Test algorithm logic thoroughly&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Understand societal and data implications&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;... and more!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="convolutionalneuralnetworksforimageclassification"&gt;&lt;a id="convolutionalneuralnetworksforimageclassification" href="https://youtu.be/bgfDLx0pDVc"&gt;Convolutional Neural Networks for Image Classification&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Discover convolutional neural networks (CNNs) - the image recognition technology behind self-driving cars, facial recognition, fingerprint matching and more. Learn all about this popular type of neural network while building two models for identifying handwritten numbers - one using TensorFlow 2.0 (a highly popular machine learning library), and another using Keras (a modular library specifically for neural networks).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;You will learn:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;How image recognition works&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Real-world applications of image recognition&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;What the MNIST dataset is, and how to access and use it&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Building, training, and testing CNN models with Tensorflow&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Building, training, and testing CNN models with Keras&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;...and more!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="machinelearningwithpythonandtensorflow"&gt;&lt;a id="machinelearningwithpythonandtensorflow" href="https://youtu.be/HoSkEqU3X5Q"&gt;Machine Learning with Python and Tensorflow&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Machine learning is increasingly being used by companies to better process data and make more accurate predictions. This course takes a practical approach to teaching machine learning. Using Python and TensorFlow 2.0, the leading library for building, training, and testing machine learning programs, you’ll build a linear regression model from scratch and train its pattern recognition with various data. By the end, you'll develop a strong understanding of the underlying algorithms after you’ve gained an intuitive understanding of the fundamentals.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;You will learn:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;What machine learning is&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Real-world applications of machine learning&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Installation and setup for TensorFlow 2.0&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Plotting and graph creation with NumPy and Matplotlib&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;How to build and train a linear regression model&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;...and more!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="nextjsproject_ai-poweredexpensetracker"&gt;&lt;a id="nextjsproject_ai-poweredexpensetracker" href="https://youtu.be/wHgi6gYZOV8"&gt;Next.js Project - AI-Powered Expense Tracker&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Build a sophisticated AI-powered financial assistant with Next.js and Gemini!&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;Modern web development is rapidly shifting toward AI-first architectures that transform static user interfaces into intelligent, conversational experiences. In this course, you will build a complete, real-world project that leverages natural language processing to automate expense tracking. By integrating advanced function calling, you will gain the expertise needed to develop dynamic, data-driven applications that bridge the gap between user intent and database actions.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will learn how to:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;Architect AI-driven Next.js applications&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Implement natural language input parsing&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Execute secure database function calls&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Master Drizzle ORM for data&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Sync real-time dashboard state updates&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Integrate the Gemini AI SDK&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;p&gt;... and more!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="introtonextjsforwebappdevelopment"&gt;&lt;a id="introtonextjsforwebappdevelopment" href="https://youtu.be/uLKY2T7iTjU"&gt;Intro to Next.js for Web App Development&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Master the cutting-edge capabilities of Next.js for high-performance web applications!&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;Modern web development demands architecture that balances powerful server-side logic with seamless, interactive client experiences. Through this course, you will master the foundations of Next.js 16.2, learning to architect high-performance apps through hands-on technical exercises. These advanced architectural skills will empower you to transition from basic React components to engineering scalable, industry-standard web platforms.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You'll learn how to:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;Implement efficient App Router patterns&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Utilize SSR, SSG, and ISR&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Architect hybrid server-client components&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Develop secure, type-safe server actions&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Structure scalable web apps&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Manage application state transitions&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;p&gt;... and more!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="buildwebappswithreact19"&gt;&lt;a id="buildwebappswithreact19" href="https://youtu.be/SCMMpyjww1Y"&gt;Build Web Apps with React 19&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Unlock the power of modern web app development with React!&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;React is the cornerstone of interactive web applications, enabling developers to create dynamic user experiences efficiently. In this course, you'll embark on a practical journey to learn the fundamentals of React and how to apply them to create dynamic frontends. These foundational skills will allow you to tackle real-world React projects confidently and start building robust, scalable web apps of all kinds.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You'll learn how to:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;Understand the React mental model&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Write and use JSX effectively&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Create reusable components effortlessly&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Manage dynamic data with state&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Handle events and user interactions&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Implement conditional rendering techniques&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;p&gt;... and more!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="introtodjangoforpythonwebappdevelopment2025edition"&gt;&lt;a id="introtodjangoforpythonwebappdevelopment2025edition" href="https://youtu.be/Wqb_c3eDu-Q"&gt;Intro to Django for Python Web App Development&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Learn how to build dynamic web apps with Django, the powerful Python-based framework!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Django is a high-level, open-source framework that simplifies the creation of dynamic and scalable web applications. In this course, you'll build a fully-fledged multi-page website, exploring key concepts such as Django's Model-View-Template (MVT) architecture, dynamic content generation, and project organization. By the end, you'll have the foundational skills needed to create your own complete web app projects and expand into more Django topics.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;You’ll learn how to:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Set up and configure a Django project&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Understand Django's MVT architecture&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Create dynamic templates with context data&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Control page navigation with URLs and views&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Work with static files, including CSS&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Build a simple multi-page web app&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;... and more!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="masterdatabasesandformsfordjangowebapps"&gt;&lt;a id="masterdatabasesandformsfordjangowebapps" href="https://youtu.be/dr1opXBUChU"&gt;Master Databases and Forms for Django Web Apps&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Unlock the essentials of building data-heavy web applications with Django!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Django makes it easy to manage and organize data due to its database-driven approach that powers everything from personal blogs to large community sites. In this course, you’ll learn how to connect, structure, and work with data as you develop common, real-world features seen on many of today's web apps. By practicing these core skills, you’ll boost your confidence in databases for web development and lay the groundwork for creating more advanced apps with Django.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;You'll learn how to:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Define models and database structures&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Apply and manage database migrations&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Customize the Django admin interface&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Build and validate user forms&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Implement authentication workflows securely&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Set up permissions and access control&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;... and more!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="buildasaasappwithpython_unit1_backend"&gt;&lt;a id="buildasaasappwithpython_unit1_backend" href="https://youtu.be/S6PYvK2ARF4"&gt;Build a SaaS App with Python - Unit 1 - Backend&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Build a fully-fledged SaaS backend for web apps!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Modern SaaS (Software as a Service) apps are the backbone of today’s tech-driven businesses, and learning their architecture gives you real-world skills to create the tools the industry needs. In this course, you’ll develop a robust SaaS backend using Python and FastAPI, implementing authentication, database management, and core business logic for an AI-powered story generation app. By mastering these advanced backend techniques, you’ll be equipped to power up your own SaaS products.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;You’ll learn how to:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Set up a full FastAPI project&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Design a scalable project structure&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Implement JWT-based authentication&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Manage users and secure passwords&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Build and connect SQLModel databases&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Develop a credit-based usage system&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;... and more!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="buildasaasappwithpython_unit2_frontend"&gt;&lt;a id="buildasaasappwithpython_unit2_frontend" href="https://youtu.be/3jY2Z6qsMbQ"&gt;Build a SaaS App with Python - Unit 2 - Frontend&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Take your SaaS skills to the next level by building a complete Python web app!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;From managing user authentication to integrating AI-powered features, SaaS (Software as a Service) apps are driving today’s cutting-edge web solutions. In this course, you'll learn to create AI-powered story generation business services, connect dynamic Python API endpoints to a React-made frontend, and bring a real-world project to completion. These skills will help you gain practical experience to confidently develop end-to-end SaaS applications.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;You’ll learn how to:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;Understand complex source code&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Create an AI-powered story generator&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Integrate Python APIs with a frontend&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Implement secure user authentication&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Build dashboards and interactive UIs&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Manually test the app end-to-end&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;p&gt;... and more!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="awscertifiedaipractitioneraif-c01_prepandpass"&gt;&lt;a id="awscertifiedaipractitioneraif-c01_prepandpass"&gt;AWS Certified AI Practitioner (AIF-C01): Prep &amp; Pass&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/b1dd239eaa86e1e00ac485359c16c3e4b479cf6a.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=c3a210581ee22419547b5ce029eab392"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Explore AI and machine learning on AWS!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;AI literacy helps teams evaluate machine learning, generative AI, and cloud governance with clearer technical judgment. Through this course, you'll prepare for the AWS Certified AI Practitioner certification, AIF-C01, by studying AI and ML fundamentals and compliance through a complete exam-aligned path. These skills will help you recognize AWS AI services and reason about AI use cases, risks, and controls.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You'll learn how to:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Explain AI and ML basics&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Understand generative AI concepts&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Apply foundation model knowledge&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Review responsible AI principles&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Recognize AWS AI services&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Approach exam question formats&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;... and more!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="10practiceexamsforawscertifiedaipractitioneraif-c01"&gt;&lt;a id="10practiceexamsforawscertifiedaipractitioneraif-c01"&gt;10 Practice Exams for AWS Certified AI Practitioner (AIF-C01)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/e4d9925aa10cc329bed2acefcf0a7250fdb74374.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=3c00e6d3daa3a4b91309c474cbb575d0"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Practice applied AWS AI knowledge!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;AI certification practice is strongest when learners test recall across foundation models, responsible AI, and cloud governance under timed conditions. These practice exams help you validate readiness for the AWS Certified AI Practitioner certification, AIF-C01, with ten full-length exams split into responsive parts and weighted across every official domain from start to finish. These sessions will help you identify gaps in AI, generative AI, foundation model applications, security, compliance, and governance.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You'll practice how to:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Simulate AI exam timing&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Review all AIF domains&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Interpret best-answer AI scenarios&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Spot qualifying AWS constraints&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Assess responsible AI concepts&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Validate certification readiness&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;... and more!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
