      <description>&lt;div&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/8c889b6b6cb50bd7027668592e623789dc29233d.png?auto=compress,format&amp;h=340&amp;w=1200&amp;s=f0d87b99c896eff4dcbee235b6cfeac0"&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/3b4450d10fdb29377274782e5a4f053bffd4d896.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=crop&amp;h=600&amp;w=1200&amp;s=3ab209cbd9e5b0ef3f21c3ebecf324e3"&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Fine-tune your game dev skills!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Learn how to create your own video games in Unreal Engine with the power of C++ from the pros at GameDev.tv! This all-new Humble Video Learning Bundle contains everything you need to learn the fundamentals. Master modern game development with comprehensive courses designed to help you succeed quickly, including &lt;em&gt;Math For Video Games&lt;/em&gt;, &lt;em&gt;FPS Music Asset&lt;/em&gt;, and &lt;em&gt;Unreal Engine Blueprint Game Developer&lt;/em&gt;. Get the expert education you seek from the professionals at GameDev.tv, and help support Girls Who Code with your purchase! &lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;span style="color: #ef9741;"&gt;Keys expire. Please redeem your keys before October 29th, 2027. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#0"&gt;Pay $5 to unlock!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#unrealgamefeel_ahands-onpracticecourse"&gt;Unreal Game Feel: A Hands-On Practice Course&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#unreal5_masterenhancedinputwithcplusplusandblueprintscourse"&gt;Unreal 5: Master Enhanced Input with C++ &amp; Blueprints Course&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#bt15"&gt;Pay $15 or more to also unlock!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#finishit_toolsandtechniquesforstayingmotivatedandproductivewithgam"&gt;Finish It! - Tools &amp; Techniques For Staying Motivated &amp; Productive With Game Dev&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#unrealenginecinematiccreatorcourse"&gt;Unreal Engine Cinematic Creator Course&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#unrealengineblueprintgamedevelopercourse"&gt;Unreal Engine Blueprint Game Developer Course&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#bt25"&gt;Pay $25 or more to also unlock!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#fpsmusicassetpack"&gt;FPS Music Asset Pack&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#unrealmaterialpack"&gt;Unreal Material Pack&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#mathforvideogames"&gt;Math For Video Games Course&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#unreal5cplusplusdevelopercourse_projectobstacleassault"&gt;Unreal 5 C++ Developer Course: Project Obstacle Assault&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#unreal5cplusplusdevelopercourse_projectdungeonescape"&gt;Unreal 5 C++ Developer Course: Project Dungeon Escape&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#unreal5cplusplusdevelopercourse_projectbattleblaster"&gt;Unreal 5 C++ Developer Course: Project Battle Blaster&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#unreal5cplusplusdevelopercourse_projectshootersam"&gt;Unreal 5 C++ Developer Course: Project Shooter Sam&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#unrealengine5environmentdesigncourse"&gt;Unreal Engine 5 Environment Design Course&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#unrealengine5_actionadventuregamedevelopmentcourse"&gt;Unreal Engine 5: Action Adventure Game Development Course&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#unrealengine5_buildacompletesurvivalgamewithblueprintcourse"&gt;Unreal Engine 5: Build a Complete Survival Game with Blueprint Course&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#unreal5stealthcombat_makestealthgamesinue5blueprint"&gt;Unreal 5 Stealth Combat: Make Stealth Games in UE5 Blueprint&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2 id="0"&gt;Pay $5 to unlock!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="unrealgamefeel_ahands-onpracticecourse"&gt;&lt;a id="unrealgamefeel_ahands-onpracticecourse" href="https://youtu.be/8ulVH8TRcqQ"&gt;Unreal Game Feel: A Hands-On Practice Course&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Explore how small changes can make a big difference to player experience in this relaxed, practical Unreal Engine 5.3 course. You’ll build a simple first-person setup, then tweak movement, add screen shake, throw in some particle effects, and experiment with basic UI and enemy reactions - all in the name of better “game feel.”&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;It’s not a masterclass in polish, it’s a sandbox for Unreal creators who want to play, learn and discover what clicks. Ideal if you’ve got the basics of scripting and want to try a different side of development.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Give it a go and see how it feels!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="unreal5_masterenhancedinputwithcplusplusandblueprintscourse"&gt;&lt;a id="unreal5_masterenhancedinputwithcplusplusandblueprintscourse" href="https://youtu.be/-PYgrc0VQCI"&gt;Unreal 5: Master Enhanced Input with C++ &amp; Blueprints Course&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ready to unlock your game dev superpowers? Our Unreal Enhanced Input course is here to help you ditch the old system and master the shiny new one. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;You’ll set up custom input mappings, bind actions like a legend (C++ or Blueprint—your call), and finally understand those “what even are these” topics like value types, trigger states, and input modifiers. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;By the end, you’ll be designing characters that move, rotate, and interact with controls smoother than your favourite speedrun. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;No fluff, no jargon, just clear, practical lessons that make learning fun. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Grab the bundle now and let’s level up!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id="bt15"&gt;Pay $15 or more to also unlock!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="finishit_toolsandtechniquesforstayingmotivatedandproductivewithgam"&gt;&lt;a id="finishit_toolsandtechniquesforstayingmotivatedandproductivewithgam" href="https://youtu.be/6mb70_kRU6I"&gt;Finish It! - Tools &amp; Techniques For Staying Motivated &amp; Productive With Game Dev&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Finish what you start - and start what you care about.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Whether you’re building a game, an app, a portfolio or a personal project, Finish It helps you overcome procrastination, get unstuck and make real progress.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;You’ll explore simple, powerful techniques to beat overwhelm, plan your next steps, stay focused and follow through. It’s not about grinding harder, it’s about working smarter, with clarity and purpose.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Packed with real-world advice, proven strategies and a step-by-step workbook, this course gives you the structure and momentum to finally finish your creative projects.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="unrealenginecinematiccreatorcourse"&gt;&lt;a id="unrealenginecinematiccreatorcourse" href="https://youtu.be/OLnsNn92yhU"&gt;Unreal Engine Cinematic Creator Course&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Make your own cinematic moments (cut-scenes and gameplay moments) using Unreal Engine 4's Sequencer Tool.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Sequencer (which is included with the Unreal Editor - no additional download necessary) is a powerful editor which allows you to add tracks and animate everything from your cameras to your characters to your world.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;In this course you’ll learn how to:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;+ Create your own non-interactive cut-scene which is triggered from gameplay.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;+ Compose interesting camera shots and animate your cameras as if you were Steven Spielberg's personal camera operator.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;+ Create movement and flavor in your levels by animating world events to take place as the player moves through your level (explosions and landslides anyone?).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;+ Create simple gameplay systems such as allowing the player to open doors when they run near them.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;+ Create animation sequences and render them to movie format so that you can make your own short films!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="unrealengineblueprintgamedevelopercourse"&gt;&lt;a id="unrealengineblueprintgamedevelopercourse" href="https://youtu.be/tXyPXBsQT0E"&gt;Unreal Engine Blueprint Game Developer Course&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/6f23be789d5e31e3ff21fbdbdd1f0fda9fa712ff.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=671fb69f3a78076bc7bbd89ef3f9b743"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Learn to build games in Unreal Engine 5 - no coding required!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Newly remastered from the ground up for Unreal Engine 5.6, this beginner-friendly course shows you how to make your first games using Blueprints, Unreal’s powerful visual scripting system.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;We start slow, no experience needed, and guide you step-by-step through creating games like Marble Run and Crystal Caverns - where you’ll master movement, collisions, triggers, level design, and player interaction, all without writing a line of code.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This is the perfect launchpad into game development if you want to bring your ideas to life fast.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Created in collaboration with Epic Games, this best-selling course gives you the skills and confidence to start building fully playable projects from the ground up.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id="bt25"&gt;Pay $25 or more to also unlock!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="fpsmusicassetpack"&gt;&lt;a id="fpsmusicassetpack" href="https://youtu.be/oZzokOAM2b0"&gt;FPS Music Asset Pack&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Listen to the sounds of FPS action with 15 tracks of epic rhythm. Whether you're taking an arrow to the knee, or trying to save humanity from an alien invasion, this pack has everything you need musically to create an FPS or action game set in a far away land.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Includes both MP3 files and high quality WAV files!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This pack was designed by composer Jorge Velasco, and includes a wide range of compositions for varying emotions and landscapes!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="unrealmaterialpack"&gt;&lt;a id="unrealmaterialpack"&gt;Unreal Material Pack&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/a3f70b4df327f175ff092596d57008c3e1f7c4f2.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=a9e49a18cd7a6043cf04a5b3da332df7"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Make your game POP with this Materials Pack for Unreal! Stone, metal, gravel, rust, wood and so many more textures! This pack includes dozens of materials directly usable in Unreal Engine 5.1 to make your games look AMAZING! And with the included .Unreal scene file, you can get right into the action.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This material asset pack pack features:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;24 master materials with some variations&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;50 material instances&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;A preview map&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1 Unreal Engine file with all the materials in them&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;And you'll get the most out of it because:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This pack is built for use in your own projects&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;You can use these materials to make your games look better&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;All materials are fully configurable in Unreal Engine 5.1&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;All materials work for any mesh&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;All materials are specially designed to be loopable and tileable&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This pack is perfect for any type of Unreal Engine game!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="mathforvideogames"&gt;&lt;a id="mathforvideogames" href="https://youtu.be/UDXpkO7qalI"&gt;Math For Video Games Course&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Build better games by levelling up your maths.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;From smooth movement and enemy targeting to random drops and projectile arcs, maths powers every corner of game development.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This course breaks down the core concepts behind vectors, trigonometry, probability and more, all through real-world game problems. You’ll understand why each concept matters, and how to turn it into logic you can use in any language - from C++ to C# to Python.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Whether you're brushing up or starting fresh, this is practical maths made fun AND made for game devs.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="unreal5cplusplusdevelopercourse_projectobstacleassault"&gt;&lt;a id="unreal5cplusplusdevelopercourse_projectobstacleassault" href="https://youtu.be/i3VLtgxRaWk"&gt;Unreal 5 C++ Developer Course: Project Obstacle Assault&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Remastered for Unreal Engine 5.6 - bigger, slicker and smoother than ever.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Create your own third-person shooter in this 7 and a half hour project - featuring polished combat, animation blueprints, AI behaviour trees and more.You’ll code enemy behaviour, add satisfying feedback and polish gameplay using real AAA‑style techniques - all in clean C++ that YOU write.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shooter Sam is the grand finale of our full C++ journey, tying together everything you’ve learned into a game your friends will actually want to play.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Grab the bundle and finish strong - UE dev mode unlocked!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="unreal5cplusplusdevelopercourse_projectdungeonescape"&gt;&lt;a id="unreal5cplusplusdevelopercourse_projectdungeonescape" href="https://youtu.be/HmKjMVJ-q3I"&gt;Unreal 5 C++ Developer Course: Project Dungeon Escape&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Now rebuilt and refined for Unreal 5.6!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Turn C++ into pure firepower by building a tank battler from the ground up in this epic 6 hour project.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Drive, aim, fire projectiles, damage enemies and create a working HUD using Unreal’s UI tools. You’ll add behaviours that fight back and start to feel like a real gameplay programmer.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This is the “things explode now” part of our full Unreal C++ course - where all your earlier skills start combining into something seriously fun.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Load up, lock on and grab the bundle to keep levelling up!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="unreal5cplusplusdevelopercourse_projectbattleblaster"&gt;&lt;a id="unreal5cplusplusdevelopercourse_projectbattleblaster" href="https://youtu.be/gsZIHLyIo5c"&gt;Unreal 5 C++ Developer Course: Project Battle Blaster&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Fully updated for Unreal 5.6!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Break out of a mysterious dungeon while mastering line traces, delegates, components, pick‑ups, dynamic lighting, puzzle triggers and more.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;You’ll write proper C++ gameplay code that responds to the world around you and discover what makes Unreal an industry giant  - in this 7 hour journey packed with practical game dev skills.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;It’s the perfect mid‑course challenge in our full C++ learning journey: more mechanics, more problem‑solving, more “ooh that’s cool!” moments.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Unlock the next step of your UE5 dev adventure - grab the bundle now!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="unreal5cplusplusdevelopercourse_projectshootersam"&gt;&lt;a id="unreal5cplusplusdevelopercourse_projectshootersam" href="https://youtu.be/oyD1jNWmZ60"&gt;Unreal 5 C++ Developer Course: Project Shooter Sam&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Newly remastered for Unreal Engine 5.6!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Start your C++ journey with a fast-paced platformer that teaches core movement, jumping, collisions and game logic - all while building a polished playable level from scratch.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;In just under 5 hours, you'll go from total beginner to writing clean, beginner-friendly C++ scripts and hooking them into Unreal’s powerful editor tools - step by step.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This is your first milestone in our complete Unreal C++ developer pathway… and a super fun one at that.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Pick up the bundle and take your first leap into UE5!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="unrealengine5environmentdesigncourse"&gt;&lt;a id="unrealengine5environmentdesigncourse" href="https://youtu.be/uKNKtAPGd9k"&gt;Unreal Engine 5 Environment Design Course&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/e451e93f57e8460b23d88e50f6af866bb1932d8f.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=19ecbe8ee7145b60e28926d765807362"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Design stunning natural environments in Unreal Engine 5.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;In this hands-on project, you’ll learn to create visually compelling outdoor scenes using powerful tools like the Landscape and Foliage brushes, plus hand-placed assets from Quixel Megascans.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;You’ll craft a layout that guides the player naturally, fine-tune your lighting and post-processing, and make key visual tweaks to ensure every asset blends beautifully.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Whether you’re aiming for a cinematic render or game-ready level, this course will teach you how to think like an environment artist and bring your world to life with clarity and confidence.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="unrealengine5_actionadventuregamedevelopmentcourse"&gt;&lt;a id="unrealengine5_actionadventuregamedevelopmentcourse" href="https://youtu.be/3euSbWzxmwY"&gt;Unreal Engine 5: Action Adventure Game Development Course&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Build your dream third-person action adventure game with Unreal Engine!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;In this project-based course, you’ll learn how to create dynamic gameplay features like hazards, interactables, pickups, enemy damage, and triggerable events - all using Unreal’s powerful Blueprint system.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;You’ll design your own playable level and develop a solid understanding of how to bring immersive action mechanics to life.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Perfect for beginners and creatives looking to level up their UE5 skills with a hands-on project that looks great and plays even better.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="unrealengine5_buildacompletesurvivalgamewithblueprintcourse"&gt;&lt;a id="unrealengine5_buildacompletesurvivalgamewithblueprintcourse" href="https://youtu.be/QKvhkQ4KF4o"&gt;Unreal Engine 5: Build a Complete Survival Game with Blueprint Course&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ever dreamt of crafting your own survival game? &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;With this Unreal Engine 5 course, you’ll build a full-fledged survival adventure from scratch—tropical island, grid inventory, and enemy AI included! &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Learn to master modular systems for crafting, building, and looting, all while optimising Blueprints for smooth gameplay. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Chop trees, battle foes, and design a stunning island paradise, step by step. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Whether you’re stuck on mechanics or new to modular coding, we’ve got you covered. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;No half-finished projects here—just a polished survival game you’ll be proud of. Ready to conquer the wild? Nab this bundle and let’s dive in!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="unreal5stealthcombat_makestealthgamesinue5blueprint"&gt;&lt;a id="unreal5stealthcombat_makestealthgamesinue5blueprint" href="https://youtu.be/7CJ89ERGEKY"&gt;Unreal 5 Stealth Combat: Make Stealth Games in UE5 Blueprint&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/c2395a2699fc0e19df2fafa62051d03ab4a608f2.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=52973c1909c06add5a3a77b507814fa3"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ready to create a third-person stealth game in Unreal Engine 5 - no coding required!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;You’ll build patrol AI, security cameras, detection systems, knockouts, health, HUDs and more using Unreal’s powerful Blueprint visual scripting.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Perfect for artists, designers and solo devs, this project-based course teaches you how to design immersive stealth mechanics and keep your players on edge.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;By the end, you’ll have a solid foundation in UE5’s gameplay systems and a stealth prototype you’ll be proud of.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Whether it’s shadows, strategy or silent takedowns - this course has you covered.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
