      <description>&lt;div&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/058dfaa248070f9be8298ad7229c09da07c0a4d6.png?auto=compress,format&amp;h=340&amp;w=1200&amp;s=f84fa1ed4dea1e65e6ab8cfc44334d89"&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/637f71e8c077d934ab61250a205bdca00e26f336.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=crop&amp;h=600&amp;w=1200&amp;s=46247674bd53bbfa3b45e801615eb802"&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Become your own business&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Be your own boss and take on the digital realm with this bundle of digital marketing, social media, commerce, and AI tools from Mammoth Club to help you build your own business and become a successful solopreneur! Here you’ll find tools to assist you with basically everything from building and pricing your indie games to creating branded AR and marketing your products on social media! Learn the ins and outs of being a digital influencer and marketing your games to the most people! This bundle includes 35 courses and how-to manuals to kick-start your one-person business! Get them all now at the price of your choosing, and support the World Wildlife Fund with your purchase! &lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;span style="color: #ef9741;"&gt;Keys Expire. Please redeem before October 5, 2027. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#0"&gt;Pay $5 to unlock!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#chatgptpromptsandanalysisforleadership"&gt;ChatGPT Prompts and Analysis for Leadership&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#bt15"&gt;Pay $15 or more to also unlock!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#chatgptforstrategicdecisionmaking"&gt;ChatGPT for Strategic Decision Making&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#bt20"&gt;Pay $20 or more to also unlock!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#priceandmonetizeyourindiegamesfirst-timeexclusivehumblebundlerelea"&gt;Price and Monetize Your Indie Games &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#buildgamesandbrandedaugmentedrealityintikt