ice exam with unlimited attempts.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Certificate of completion&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Next quarter's numbers depend on what you learn from this one. Enroll today!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="chatgptforbusinessowners"&gt;&lt;a id="chatgptforbusinessowners" href="https://youtu.be/9RRjFdD5ojM"&gt;ChatGPT for Business Owners&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/abcf2e15b2efa68d8c50857149a57d72e8eb0870.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=76cf851773c35b57a1c9002f11e815a5"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;A thought partner that answers at midnight. This video course covers using ChatGPT that way as a business owner.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;You'll apply it to employee questions, onboarding, and internal communication.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► What a thought partner is and how to use ChatGPT as one.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Answering employee queries quickly and accurately.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Assisting with onboarding.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Improving communication and collaboration.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;A source file is included.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Lifetime access to all modules.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Source files included&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Certificate of completion&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The decisions on your desk today won't wait. Start now!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="chatgptforglobalbusinessengagement"&gt;&lt;a id="chatgptforglobalbusinessengagement" href="https://youtu.be/9RRjFdD5ojM"&gt;ChatGPT for Global Business Engagement&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/d82d981cfda4594a3825d32d41d2783ea5753143.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=b514da231dace16767113ee049ee4fb3"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Working across languages and cultures adds friction to every message. This video course uses ChatGPT to reduce it.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;You'll tailor messages for different audiences, translate, and handle cultural differences.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Improving customer and employee engagement.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Ta